  "description": "Throw a legendary Haro BMX freestyler and a Haro mountain bike in a smelter and you get the ultimate freestyle mountain bike â€“ the Steel Reserve 1.3. The Steel Reserve 1.3 is 100% 4130 chromoly, butted for maximum strength and weight savings while boasting CNC horizontal slotted interchangeable Six Shooter dropouts for superior versatility. The Steel Reserve 1.3 is a custom built bike without the custom built price tag, featuring premium components like an X Fusion Velvet R fork, Alienation Skylark double-wall rims, Haro 3 piece chromoly cranks and sealed thin pedals.\nFull 4130 chromoly frame with integrated head tube, Euro BB shell, removable cable guides, and our \"Six-Shooter\" interchangeable dropout system\nAvailable in Short (21.8\" TT) and Long (22.3\" TT)\nX Fusion Velvet R 80mm travel suspension fork with X-15 tool-less 15mm thru axle\nThree-piece chromoly 175mm 8-spline cranks with 6000-series alloy 25t sprocket\nGravity Gap OS riser bar (25mm Rise) with Gravity Gap 45mm stem\n6000 series alloy CNC'd Thin Pedal with removable pins and sealed bearings\nAlienation Skylark double-wall rims\nTektro Draco hydraulic rear brake with 160mm wave rotor\nPivotal seat and post",
